{"version":1,"key":"quest:131","content":{"id":131,"title":"img、figure、picture 各元素的使用对比","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:131","type":"quest","id":131},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"img、figure、picture 三个标签的区别","meta":"","excerpt":"<img>、<figure> 和 <picture> 是三个含义相近的 HTML 标签，从字面意思上看，三者似乎都和图片有关，所以有必要区分一下它们各自的职责和适用场景。 <img> 是最基础的图片标签，职责很单纯，就是显示一张图片： <img \n  src=\"photo.jpg\" \n  alt=\"一只猫在阳光下打盹\"","target":{"key":"card:741","type":"card","id":741},"citeKey":"card:741"}],"trail":[{"time":1768490827317,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1779931287610,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1779950724884,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1768490827317,"updateTime":1768490827317,"resolvedTime":1779950724884},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1768490827317}}